You are good enough for Gehennom. You have MR, reflection
and a low AC. I once did all of Gehennom with -15 AC without
any problems. I've seen ascension posts where the AC was
higher than yours. There are many fire traps in Gehennom.
Excalibur would help you avoid some. Armor needs to be
fireproof or at least blessed. Potions and scrolls in your
inventory are at risk.

Blessed weapons do a bit of extra damage to the demons. I
don't worry about the cursing so much until I wake up the
wizard. Then you probably should have another regular sack
to hold a bit of HW and/or a ?oRC. You can even put your BoH
in your sack to keep it from getting cursed if you have the
patience.

As to the various items you want, the VotD is a veritable
treasure trove. There must be 20 or more boxes and chests.
You can dig up another twenty or so graves. I don't think
the alignment hit is enough to hurt too much. You'll be
driving it up killing a kazillion undead.
